I haven't tested the code, but I believe this can be written as something like the following:

```
let timeout = u32::try_from(config.notification_timeout).unwrap_or_else(|| {
  log::trace!("Configured notification timeout not within bounds. Defaulting to {} ms", v);
  CmdDurationConfig::default().notification_timeout as u32
});
```

which would be stylistically more similar to the rest of the codebase.

